{"product":{"id":8488433811795,"title":"KEVIN.MURPHY POWDER.PUFF","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-b1ieoh-3 egVaUV\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-aohf13-8 fKQRhg\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-aohf13-9 eFERGv\"\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e \u003cstrong\u003eWEIGHTLESS VOLUMISING POWDER \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBY KEVIN MURPHY\u003c\/strong\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-aohf13-9 eFERGv\"\u003eAn instant poof in a jar! Here’s the perfect little PUFF to create the coveted messy, casual volume that everyone desires. Simply tap gently, apply a few shakes onto the hair and the powder morphs into a setting product with lasting hold. Builds body with ease, and is suitable for all hair types. The magic of our special little PUFF is all in the technology – imagine a hardworking volumising lotion, locked inside a sphere of powder – then imagine the sphere making contact with the hair – Va Va Voom, and the magic happens. The lotion lifts the hair, and the powder simultaneously dries the lotion, giving your hair some serious extra oomph.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-aohf13-9 eFERGv\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"description-tab\" aria-hidden=\"false\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-b1ieoh-1 eaIZbh\"\u003e\n\u003csection class=\"sc-aohf13-13 sc-1eu1dd2-0 iGFsTL fotHFG\" id=\"pdDescription\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-aohf13-14 sc-1eu1dd2-1 fpMnDJ hJioHz\" id=\"pd-description-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-1uodfit-0 kWmpmn\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"sc-1eu1dd2-3 fsHaA-D\" data-testid=\"pd-description-text\" id=\"pd-description-text\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeightless volumising powder doesn’t weigh the hair down\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUnique dry-matte texture\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTargeted application to boost flat hair of any type\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSetting lotion encapsulated in a powder sphere\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProvides instant volume and body\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for fine or flat hair or for just a little extra oomph\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSulphate, paraben and cruelty-free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSHAKE. PUFF. CREATE.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSprinkle \u003c\/span\u003ePOWDER.PUFF\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e onto dry hair at the roots to create volume and texture.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/section\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"hair powder","created_at":"2023-08-04T19:00:08+03:00","handle":"powder-puff","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:25+03:00","published_at":"2023-08-04T19:00:08+03:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"COSMETICS, hair, kevin.murphy, powder, volume","variants":[{"id":46927753937235,"product_id":8488433811795,"title":"14g","price":"30.00","sku":"KM-POWDERPUFF-14G","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"14g","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2023-08-04T19:00:08+03:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:25+03:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"NA","grams":0,"image_id":null,"weight":0.0,"weight_unit":"kg","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"EUR","compare_at_price_currency":"","quantity_price_breaks":[]}],"options":[{"id":11100305359187,"product_id":8488433811795,"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["14g"]}],"images":[{"id":51724433588563,"product_id":8488433811795,"position":1,"created_at":"2023-08-04T19:00:08+03:00","updated_at":"2023-08-04T